# 187: Ride or Die (55530036), FIRST-RUN: no profile on the disk. PLAYED by
# nav.py on the Nova, 2026-09-29 19:21 PDT (lane.titleroutes session 37,
# HELD; nav session 187-ride-or-die.first-run-20260929T192056).
#
# DRAFT, NOT REPLAYED: the session made the profile the Nova now has, so a
# first-run replay would need that profile gone first. The steps are the
# nav session's, with its waits.
#
# The empty profile list's A opens a name keyboard; one A enters the
# highlighted letter ("N") and Y validates, which goes straight to the main
# menu. The first race of a new profile shows a controller-configuration
# screen (Classic) before the tutorial clip; A accepts it. Everything else
# is as in 187-ride-or-die.returning.route, which has replayed.
#
# The profile is written to the disk only when the app is backgrounded
# (route.sh `flush`); this route does not flush, because a flush after
# `mark gameplay` stops rendering and reads as a hang.
wait 5.0
shot boot
wait 25.0
shot title
mark title
press START 150
wait 4.0
shot profile-select
mark profile-select
press A
wait 2.0
shot keyboard
press A
wait 1.0
press Y
wait 3.0
shot main-menu
mark profile-created
axis LX max
axis LX mid
wait 1.0
shot quick-hits
mark quick-hits
press A
wait 3.0
shot mission
press A
wait 3.0
shot fighter
press A
wait 3.0
shot car
press A
wait 4.0
shot controls
mark controls
press A
wait 4.0
shot tutorial
mark tutorial
press A
wait 12.0
shot race
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    hold A
    wait 3
    axis LX max
    wait 0.4
    axis LX mid
    wait 2
    axis LX min
    wait 0.4
    axis LX mid
    wait 2
    release A
    wait 0.3
}
